{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35425","headline":"王远宴麻姑蔡经宅 · 曹唐","name":"王远宴麻姑蔡经宅","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"好风吹树杏花香，花下真人道姓王。\n大篆龙蛇随笔札，小天星斗满衣裳。\n闲抛南极归期晚，笑指东溟饮兴长。\n要唤麻姑同一醉，使人沽酒向余杭。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"曹唐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35425.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35425","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}